'''Etched''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 12th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
This knife uses the default knife mesh, with a grey skull and 5 tally marks [Likely resembling a bone] carved into its blade, hence the name.
